<BaseLayout title="Driving School Software for UK ADIs | DVSA Tracking | DriveSchoolPro" description="Driving school software built for UK ADIs. Full DVSA 27-skills tracking, three-way scheduling with conflict detection, automated reminders, and pupil portal. Free during early access — until 31 March 2027." image="/images/marketing/calendar-week-view.webp">
